---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Keyslar"
description: "Hamkor marketing agentligi mijozlari bilan ishlangan loyihalar va erishilgan natijalar."
permalink: "/keyslar/"
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Keyslar</span>
    <h1>Ish natijalari</h1>
    <p class="lead">Kartaga sichqonchani olib boring — loyiha ochiladi. Bosilganda qisqacha ma'lumot va natijalar chiqadi.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--cream">
  <div class="wrap-full">
    {% if collections.keyslar.length %}

    <div class="deck-wrap">
      <div class="deck{% if collections.keyslar.length < 4 %} deck--few{% endif %}" role="list">
        {% for k in collections.keyslar %}
        <div class="deck__item" role="listitem" style="--i: {{ loop.index0 }}; --n: {{ collections.keyslar.length }}">
          <button class="deck__card" type="button"
                  aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="work-{{ loop.index }}">
            <span class="deck__media">
              <img src="{{ k.data.rasm or '/assets/og.png' }}" alt="{{ k.data.mijoz }} loyihasi — {{ k.data.xizmat | lower }}, {{ k.data.soha | lower }}" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900">
            </span>
            <span class="deck__foot">
              <span class="deck__name">{{ k.data.mijoz }}</span>
              <span class="deck__tag">{{ k.data.xizmat }}</span>
            </span>
          </button>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="deck-hint">Yon tomonga suring yoki kartani bosing</p>

    <div class="wrap">
      {% for k in collections.keyslar %}
      <div class="work__panel" id="work-{{ loop.index }}" hidden>
        <div class="work__panel-in">
          <div class="work__text">
            <span class="work__eyebrow">{{ k.data.mijoz }} · {{ k.data.soha }}{% if k.data.muddat %} · {{ k.data.muddat }}{% endif %}</span>
            <h3>{{ k.data.title }}</h3>
            {{ k.templateContent | safe }}

            {% if k.data.maqola %}
            <a class="btn btn--dark work__link" href="{{ k.data.maqola }}">Loyiha haqida batafsil</a>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          {% if k.data.korsatkichlar.length %}
          <div class="metrics">
            {% for m in k.data.korsatkichlar %}
            <div><span class="val">{{ m.qiymat }}</span><span class="key">{{ m.nomi }}</span></div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {% else %}
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="empty">
        <h3>Keyslar hali qo'shilmagan</h3>
        <p>Birinchi keysni qo'shish uchun admin panelga kiring: <code>/admin</code> → Keyslar → New Keys.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
